<title>FINLAND: Nokia 1996 results due February 13.</title>
<headline>Nokia 1996 results due February 13.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish telecommunications group Nokia Oy said in a statement on Tuesday it will publish its full-year 1996 results (January-December) on Thursday, February 13 at around 1300/1100 GMT.</p>
<p>Nokia will hold a news conference with president and CEO Jorma Ollila present at the company headquarters, it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
